# Navia Xilonen Durin Xianyun. ~20s Rot. Navia Plunge. 2 Xilonen skills, one funneled to Navia. Rotation gives TTDS to Navia for both skills and all plunges. C0 Xilonen doesn't provide RES shred but is worth using for energy and Scroll.

# Team: Options listed by DPS
navia char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
navia add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
navia add set="nighttime" count=4;
#navia add set="lno" count=4;
navia add stats hp=4780 atk=311 atk%=0.466 geo%=0.466 cr=0.311; #main
